{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fc923df9c3d5123fcef5ed71d83a9b74.avif?t=1773839285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras_big/fc923df9c3d5123fcef5ed71d83a9b74.webp?t=1773839285 width=1560 height=520 /></span><i><br><br>Pigeon: A Love Story</i> is a game where you soar across to-scale replicas of iconic cities in search of your pigeon-shaped soulmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a slow game for fast times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE-SIZE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore full-scale maps of London, New York, Tokyo and other international pigeon hubs: every building, every street, and every pigeon (we did the math).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIGEON-SIM\u2122 TECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of thousands of autonomous pigeon NPCs flying and interacting in a real-time, city-wide simulation. One of them is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/2a168ea53178d701b9b7fca91e6aa8f2.poster.avif?t=1773839285\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/2a168ea53178d701b9b7fca91e6aa8f2.webm?t=1773839285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/2a168ea53178d701b9b7fca91e6aa8f2.mp4?t=1773839285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &quot;COO&quot;-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to collaborate, compete, or try to find each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game play itself, screensaver style, if you just feel like birdwatching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock in and zen out to a  soundtrack composed specifically for the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876710?t=1773839285","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876710?t=1773839285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/9ed7f83d665f46de48aff080af863a83511f7c31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773839285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/9ed7f83d665f46de48aff080af863a83511f7c31/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773839285","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/fc923df9c3d5123fcef5ed71d83a9b74.avif?t=1773839285\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras_big/fc923df9c3d5123fcef5ed71d83a9b74.webp?t=1773839285 width=1560 height=520 /></span><i><br><br>Pigeon: A Love Story</i> is a game where you soar across to-scale replicas of iconic cities in search of your pigeon-shaped soulmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a slow game for fast times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIFE-SIZE MAPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore full-scale maps of London, New York, Tokyo and other international pigeon hubs: every building, every street, and every pigeon (we did the math).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIGEON-SIM\u2122 TECH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of thousands of autonomous pigeon NPCs flying and interacting in a real-time, city-wide simulation. One of them is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/2a168ea53178d701b9b7fca91e6aa8f2.poster.avif?t=1773839285\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/2a168ea53178d701b9b7fca91e6aa8f2.webm?t=1773839285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/extras/2a168ea53178d701b9b7fca91e6aa8f2.mp4?t=1773839285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &quot;COO&quot;-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend to collaborate, compete, or try to find each other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASSIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game play itself, screensaver style, if you just feel like birdwatching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORIGINAL SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock in and zen out to a  soundtrack composed specifically for the game.</p>","developers":["Wristwork"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876710/21cc069876cd34741d1b29403107c9daf9f51c43/header.jpg?t=1773839285","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  OpenGL compatible with 128MB VRAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<stron